title: "Street Lights AI Maintenance Demo"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sampath
    given-names: Kamesh
    orcid:
repository-code: "https://github.com/kameshsampath/postgis-data-intelligence-demo"
url: "https://github.com/kameshsampath/postgis-data-intelligence-demo"
abstract: >-
  A complete demonstration of PostGIS data intelligence across two platforms. On Snowflake: PostgreSQL/PostGIS with
  pg_lake Iceberg tables, zero-pipeline sync via Catalog-Linked Database, and Snowflake Intelligence (Cortex Search +
  Cortex Analyst + ML FORECAST). On Databricks: Lakebase Postgres synced to Unity Catalog, with Genie for natural
  language analytics, Vector Search on maintenance descriptions, and AI_FORECAST for energy prediction. Features
  semantic search on maintenance text, natural language analytics, ML-powered forecasting, and interactive
  dashboards with spatial visualizations for smart city infrastructure management.
